   "rebaselined": "17 November 2026 (call 138): the story calendar mirrors the build prompts' Story calendar table. Rows P1, P4, P10 and the order story leave; P20, P21, P23 and P24 join; P5 is renamed; anchors of P5, P6, P8 and P9 follow the table; each row gains its stage and its place in the table. 20 November 2026 (call 169): P25 joins the Fulfillment stage after P24, so the seven rows after it (P9, P14, P8, P6, P20, P7, P22) move down one place (seq); nothing else in them changes. 23 November 2026 (rebuild plan Step 3): P5 opens at 17:21 ET on 8 December and P23 at 15:30 ET on 2 November (decisions of 23 November); no other row moves. 23 November 2026 (rebuild plan Step 4, Bucket 3, Part A): P24 merges into P8 (decisions of 23 November). P8 opens at 17:30 ET on 9 December, week 11, with its moment and anchor following the merged page (359 orders at that moment); P24's row leaves, so the rows after it (P25 to P22) move up one place (seq). No other row changes."
